{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港同志遊行2026活動籌委會今日（15日）公布，原定於下月14日在中環街市舉行的「彩虹市集活動」，因場地方臨時未能提供場地而取消。</p><p>籌委會表示，將盡最大努力繼續籌辦，並適時於社交媒體公布最新安排。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:34.369388+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:37:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:17:42.638047+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"54bb95dc58a363acfa7e07c27bb36874d54586fb77b567c5c057e5d2605130dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}